Description: Backport Adobe VULN-39341 (CVE-2026-75650, StyleSmuggler) onto
 Magento Open Source 2.4.7-p10. Block and URL-generator classes are validated
 before instantiation, template text and styles reject non-strings, admin
 previews require their ACL, and error reports are prefixed with an execution
 guard after PHP open tags are neutralized.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/mage-os/mageos-magento2/commit/061a96ea6dda255e076702fe5e5a972bae2fecb3
 Adobe hotfix VULN-39341 / APSB26-146 built for 2.4.7-p10
Bug: https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/magento/apsb26-146.html
Author: Root.io Novel Patcher <security@root.io>
Last-Update: 2026-10-14

